<h1>Section 3B — Governance &amp; Forensic Accounting Review</h1>
<div class="sub">Zee Entertainment Enterprises Limited (NSE: ZEEL · CIN L92132MH1982PLC028767) · Governance &amp; Forensic Accounting (GFA) framework — full six-pillar coverage · media &amp; broadcasting lens</div>
<div class="meta">
<span><b>FY basis:</b> FY2025 (yr-end 31 Mar 2025, audited — Walker Chandiok &amp; Co LLP)</span>
<span><b>Window:</b> FY2023–FY2025 (standalone &amp; consolidated)</span>
<span><b>Jurisdiction:</b> India (Maharashtra)</span>
<span><b>Sector profile:</b> Media &amp; entertainment — TV &amp; radio broadcasting, OTT, films</span>
<span><b>Sources:</b> FY2025 Annual Report (Ind AS), D7 CDD FORT10070</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="card" id="sec3b">
